  "mechanism": {
    "source": "The latest eligible completed write binds its aligned range, exact storage policy, readable open context and current namespace checkpoint. An independent leased snapshot reads the range outside the callback lock.",
    "admission": "A bounded write receipt can await fresh CPU and memory telemetry through collector warm-up. The controller uses its existing background mode, foreground epoch, stop and pacing.",
    "sample": "Private matched-geometry CPU transaction, whole private image extent and equivalent digest. Independent full CPU verification plus exact extent byte comparison precede scratch retirement and reporting.",
    "coverage": "Wrong receipt, stopped or unfunded capture, newer checkpoint, repeated consumption, cancellation after scratch reservation, exact recovery, repeated observation after one successful replay, and concurrent mutation owners of distinct memory stores."
  },
